nt-6fd39a7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"6fd39a7\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e4a0d4a\" data-id=\"e4a0d4a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d65c96 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3d65c96\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"540\" height=\"293\" src=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/SAP-training-in-Canada-3-benefits-of-using-the-accounts-receivable-feature-Configuring-Alerts-2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1563\" alt=\"SAP-training-in-Canada-3-benefits-of-using-the-accounts-receivable-feature-cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/SAP-training-in-Canada-3-benefits-of-using-the-accounts-receivable-feature-Configuring-Alerts-2.jpg 540w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/SAP-training-in-Canada-3-benefits-of-using-the-accounts-receivable-feature-Configuring-Alerts-2-300x163.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 540px) 100vw, 540px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3978e8e\" data-id=\"3978e8e\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4b29da elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f4b29da\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>One of the biggest challenges for companies is the management of their accounting, and more specifically accounts receivable. Traditional methods in this area include the use of spreadsheets, phone calls trying to reach the customer, emails and, when the tolerance period is exceeded, the customer&#8217;s service is suspended. However, this can result in the complete loss of the contract or a debt becoming too difficult for the customer to pay.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d6044f7 elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"d6044f7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-62a3164\" data-id=\"62a3164\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c7316dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c7316dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Companies that have requested<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"> <strong><a style=\"color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/sap-training-canada\/\">SAP training in Canada<\/a><\/strong><\/span> to take advantage of the accounts receivable management module have realized benefits such as:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d0b480d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d0b480d\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3ad8aef\" data-id=\"3ad8aef\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6bdf38f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6bdf38f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><strong>Configuring Alerts<\/strong><\/h3><p>SAP Business One has the option to create alerts for employees and notifications for customers who have overdue balances when an invoice is generated that has not been paid after a certain period. Staff, upon receiving the alert, can take actions such as generating credit notes or interest applied to the invoice amount, which must be calculated per day, or as stipulated in the contract.<br \/>This function also allows the automatic configuration of text messages or e-mails to the customer, in order to remind them that their invoice is overdue, or it can be programmed a couple of days in advance to prevent customers from falling into arrears.<br \/>Once the customer pays the invoice, the alerts are deactivated. It is important that during the <strong>SAP training in Canada<\/strong> you learn how to deactivate the alerts but allow them to remain visible even if they are inactive so that you know which customers should be notified and which should not.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d415bed\" data-id=\"d415bed\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-524a187 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"524a187\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"514\" height=\"384\" src=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/SAP-training-in-Canada-3-benefits-of-using-the-accounts-receivable-feature-SAP-training-in-Canada.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1557\" alt=\"Configuring Alerts\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/SAP-training-in-Canada-3-benefits-of-using-the-accounts-receivable-feature-SAP-training-in-Canada.jpg 514w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/SAP-training-in-Canada-3-benefits-of-using-the-accounts-receivable-feature-SAP-training-in-Canada-300x224.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 514px) 100vw, 514px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-50ca8f5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"50ca8f5\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4cad334\" data-id=\"4cad334\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fe45e3e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"fe45e3e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"512\" height=\"265\" src=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/SAP-training-in-Canada-3-benefits-of-using-the-accounts-receivable-feature-balance-aging-reports.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1559\" alt=\"SAP training in Canada:\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/SAP-training-in-Canada-3-benefits-of-using-the-accounts-receivable-feature-balance-aging-reports.jpg 512w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/SAP-training-in-Canada-3-benefits-of-using-the-accounts-receivable-feature-balance-aging-reports-300x155.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-aced47d\" data-id=\"aced47d\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1334492 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1334492\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><strong>SAP training in Canada:<\/strong><\/h3><p>balance aging reports<br \/>The setting up of aging reports allows you to analyze outstanding accounts so that you can extend or restrict customer service conditions, offer payment alternatives or, in the worst case, direct the account to a legal office. During the SAP training in Canada, in addition to learning how to use the module, you can define the allowable debit margin or the maximum payment tolerance period. By using this tool correctly, you can avoid a major conflict with the customer and avoid the company having liquidity problems due to non-payment of an invoice.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b7cc111 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b7cc111\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e03f761\" data-id=\"e03f761\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1fc40a6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1fc40a6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><strong>Bank Management<\/strong><\/h3><p>This function allows you to integrate the company&#8217;s information with that of the banks, so that you can schedule outgoing payments to suppliers or employees, but also income, installments, credits, advances, among others, which can be analyzed later to know data such as payment methods, journal entry transactions, taxes payable and more.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6a0ca6a\" data-id=\"6a0ca6a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-823d8cb element